<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	11.00 /10.80  11.35 /11.15   11.80 /11.60</p>
<p>BPI			11.00 /10.85  11.50 /11.15   12.00 /11.60</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.00 /10.80  11.375/11.125  11.80 /11.60</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  11.00 /10.85  11.30 /11.15   11.80 /11.65</p>
<p>Metrobank		11.00 /10.90  11.20 /11.10   11.70 /11.575</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.875/10.80  11.20 /11.10   11.65 /11.55</p>
<p>PNB			10.90 /10.80  11.10 /11.00   11.50 /11.40</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.15 /10.90  11.50 /11.25   11.95 /11.70</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
